From: kodi-ps4 dev <dev@kodi-ps4.local>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:52:35 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/12] ps4: build and toolchain support

Add the Orbis platform files, CMake glue and the FreeBSD/ELF toolchain fixes needed to configure and link Kodi for PS4. The internal FFmpeg build takes its dependency prefix from DEPS_PS4 instead of a hardcoded /tmp path.
